(line "Needs" 3 "% needs(Name, Thing): Name, or the line that leads to it, takes Thing as already told. The words")
(line "Needs" 4 "% that lean are beside each: a word that points (\"he\", \"it\", \"that\", \"same\", \"another\"), an")
(line "Needs" 5 "% answer with its question left out (\"I did.\"), or a thing spoken of as known (\"the umbrella\").")
(line "Needs" 6 "% The compiler looks for a way to Name on which Thing was never told, and if there is one it")
(line "Needs" 7 "% stops, and says the way.")
